[{"title":"刘太常亟言大城令忽君之贤也其善状非一至祷雨立澍矣予闻而贤之为赋四绝句 其四","author":"王世贞","text":"汝祷亦已久，六事无可责。\n密云天际来，宛然桑林色。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11869,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过息题息妫","author":"王世贞","text":"君王爱侵地，贱妾偶酬心。\n欲竟无言恨，那堪言外深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11870,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"买鸡","author":"王世贞","text":"儿童爱春懒，为买汝南鸡。\n不晓幽人意，翻令拂曙啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11871,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郧阳偶成 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"坐见斜阳影，离离西过楹。\n问愁无可答，底是少心情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11872,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郧阳偶成 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"骤作中年身，都无快心事。\n不知筋与骨，何处将衰至。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11873,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"茅阜峰","author":"王世贞","text":"茅君顾我笑，谁校从官多。\n欲语囊中秘，其如六耳何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11874,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"健人峰","author":"王世贞","text":"共工触不周，巨灵擘太华。\n何似此健人，立石天门下。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11875,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"系马峰","author":"王世贞","text":"天马走长空，兹峰偶一系。\n万象欲现时，聊将系吾意。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11876,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滴水岩","author":"王世贞","text":"一滴一露珠，病渴犹恨少。\n倘借行雨翁，前村成浩淼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11877,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"隐仙岩","author":"王世贞","text":"真仙不住山，那有山中迹。\n同是谪仙人，相逢不相识。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11878,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"风岩","author":"王世贞","text":"一决土囊口，居然万壑同。\n人应自寒暑，风不解雌雄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11879,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"独阳岩","author":"王世贞","text":"朔风寒不尽，惨淡结浮阴。\n念此闭关日，悠然天地心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11880,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"淩虚岩","author":"王世贞","text":"诵经淩虚台，留骨希夷峡。\n何似学刘伶，未死先荷锸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11881,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"榔梅岭","author":"王世贞","text":"人言榔梅亭，真果已堪證。\n无奈老饕何，只爱苏家杏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11882,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"青崖","author":"王世贞","text":"断崖数千尺，隐然一辎軿。\n即看摇落候，不改芙蓉青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11883,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"琼台","author":"王世贞","text":"当时受册地，今日琼台宫。\n阿母瑶池色，能如晚照红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11884,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渊默亭","author":"王世贞","text":"兹亭字渊默，我憩亦何言。\n忽有天门辟，森然帝座尊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11885,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"试心石","author":"王世贞","text":"陡出三尺崖，下临千尺地。\n道人呼试心，无心可将试。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11886,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"试剑石","author":"王世贞","text":"我有昆吾剑，不将持试石。\n白璧隐荆山，剖出长虹色。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11887,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"磨针涧","author":"王世贞","text":"铁杵磨作针，白石化作金。\n还怜磨杵客，不胜化金心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11888,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蒿谷涧","author":"王世贞","text":"野蒿长如人，菉葹亦不离。\n我欲搆一区，为延张仲蔚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11889,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金鸡涧","author":"王世贞","text":"遥望鸡鸣峰，神瀵涌如射。\n时听金鸡声，人间道天赦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11890,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"摘星桥","author":"王世贞","text":"夜半桥上星，如萤拂衣袂。\n为摘岁精来，欲验偷桃事。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11891,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒居无事偶亿古人恒语成联者因以所感足之不论其合与否也 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"何所闻而来，何所见而去。\n人自不关身，身有关人处。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11892,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒居无事偶亿古人恒语成联者因以所感足之不论其合与否也 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"前不见古人，后不见来者。\n此事久已然，如何初涕下。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11893,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒居无事偶亿古人恒语成联者因以所感足之不论其合与否也 其三","author":"王世贞","text":"兰以香自焚，膏以明自煎。\n昆冈一失火，顽石未闻全。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11894,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒居无事偶亿古人恒语成联者因以所感足之不论其合与否也 其四","author":"王世贞","text":"我自用我法，卿自用卿法。\n卿法多爱憎，我法无生灭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11895,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒居无事偶亿古人恒语成联者因以所感足之不论其合与否也 其五","author":"王世贞","text":"莫言一种物，双名亦易晓。\n处则为远志，出则为小草。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11896,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒居无事偶亿古人恒语成联者因以所感足之不论其合与否也 其六","author":"王世贞","text":"有情痴故佳，无情黠亦尔。\n琅琊王伯舆，终当为情死。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11897,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒居无事偶亿古人恒语成联者因以所感足之不论其合与否也 其七","author":"王世贞","text":"人言阿龙超，阿龙故自超。\n济南一下语，北地不成骄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11898,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒居无事偶亿古人恒语成联者因以所感足之不论其合与否也 其八","author":"王世贞","text":"法护非不佳，僧弥难为兄。\n长安啖名地，语语兰芬生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11899,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒居无事偶亿古人恒语成联者因以所感足之不论其合与否也 其九","author":"王世贞","text":"有儿不明经，好读子与史。\n仲容已预之，卿不得复尔。","collection":"明","